agx-base-srgb.bin.gz

Blender's AgX view transform lookup table for sRGB displays (AgX_Base_sRGB.cube, 57 x 57 x 57),
from Blender 5.3's colour configuration (release/datafiles/colormanagement/luts), repacked
without change beyond rounding to 16 bits: per channel, the steps along red from one entry to
the next, low bytes then high bytes, gzip compressed. nebula.js unpacks it.

Based on the original AgX by Troy Sobotka (https://github.com/sobotka/AgX); this version
developed by Zijun Eary Zhou, Mark Faderbauer and Sakari Kapanen
(https://github.com/EaryChow/AgX). Distributed with Blender (https://www.blender.org), which is
free software under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.
